(368192, 30612, 9582, '<td valign="top">This photo would be much more effective if it were larger, but I like it a lot. The composition and lighting are both very strong. The way that the light falls on the shells is nice and the pattern that the wood makes adds a lot of interest.</td>', 'This photo would be much more effective if it were larger, but I like it a lot. The composition and lighting are both very strong. The way that the light falls on the shells is nice and the pattern that the wood makes adds a lot of interest.', '2003-07-28 02:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(368193, 30575, 4805, '<td valign="top">This is a great abstract shot. It''s also a great example of a shot that should be converted to black and white. The colour noise in the shot is vary apparent and would be removed by a conversion. It''s also begging for a border, but that''s just my preference.</td>', 'This is a great abstract shot. It''s also a great example of a shot that should be converted to black and white. The colour noise in the shot is vary apparent and would be removed by a conversion. It''s also begging for a border, but that''s just my preference.', '2003-07-28 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
