(368234, 30525, 8860, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit too compressed/noisy but it''s a great shot with good DOF. [7]</td>', 'Image is a bit too compressed/noisy but it''s a great shot with good DOF. [7]', '2003-07-28 04:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(368235, 30710, 5728, '<td valign="top">My absolute favourite for the challenge! This is just beautiful. To me elephants are just a mass of gray, but here you''ve brought out the skin in an array of gray and orange tones, fantastic! Is that some kind of mud on the skin? The texture of the skin with the lines of the veins is awesome. Perfect lighting and composition. A definite 10, if I could I''d even give you a 20!</td>', 'My absolute favourite for the challenge! This is just beautiful. To me elephants are just a mass of gray, but here you''ve brought out the skin in an array of gray and orange tones, fantastic! Is that some kind of mud on the skin? The texture of the skin with the lines of the veins is awesome. Perfect lighting and composition. A definite 10, if I could I''d even give you a 20!', '2003-07-28 04:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(368239, 30541, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colours, excellen detail on the pollen etc. The nicely filled frame gives (for me) a less ''typical'' flower shot feel to it, which is refreshing. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colours, excellen detail on the pollen etc. The nicely filled frame gives (for me) a less ''typical'' flower shot feel to it, which is refreshing. Good luck with it.', '2003-07-28 05:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(368248, 30742, 1717, '<td valign="top">awesome!  i really see the "elephant" here....eye, trunk, tusk, ear...amazing textures.  you have a great eye!  the lighting is perfect....shadows and light working together to complete the illusion.  excellent work!....10</td>', 'awesome!  i really see the "elephant" here....eye, trunk, tusk, ear...amazing textures.  you have a great eye!  the lighting is perfect....shadows and light working together to complete the illusion.  excellent work!....10', '2003-07-28 05:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(368250, 30132, 1717, '<td valign="top">amazing capture...i definitely wouldn''t disturb him!  focus, lighting, composition...all perfect.  you have really captured a sense of personality here.  i''m drawn right to the eyes...very important in a great animal photo (in my opinion).  excellent work!....10</td>', 'amazing capture...i definitely wouldn''t disturb him!  focus, lighting, composition...all perfect.  you have really captured a sense of personality here.  i''m drawn right to the eyes...very important in a great animal photo (in my opinion).  excellent work!....10', '2003-07-28 05:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(368252, 30563, 1717, '<td valign="top">this has got to be jacko. ;)  i love this shot!  the detail is amazing and the tone is wonderful.  one of these days, you''ve got to tell me how you get this color so i can be a copycat and use it in one of my photos!  great photo....10</td>', 'this has got to be jacko. ;)  i love this shot!  the detail is amazing and the tone is wonderful.  one of these days, you''ve got to tell me how you get this color so i can be a copycat and use it in one of my photos!  great photo....10', '2003-07-28 05:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(368254, 30800, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool photo!  lighting is great and the detail is amazing.  i love the diagonal lines in the fabric.  good job!</td>', 'very cool photo!  lighting is great and the detail is amazing.  i love the diagonal lines in the fabric.  good job!', '2003-07-28 05:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(368255, 30651, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool photo...almost looks like a painting!  i really like that the image is desaturated...it really makes the textures in the fur stand out.  wonderful capture of his very expressive face.  great work!</td>', 'very cool photo...almost looks like a painting!  i really like that the image is desaturated...it really makes the textures in the fur stand out.  wonderful capture of his very expressive face.  great work!', '2003-07-28 05:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
