(368591, 30525, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like that your shot is from the bottom up and i like your composition, though not really ''filled''<br/>I also wish it was a little more focused.  Mostly a good shot.</td>', 'I like that your shot is from the bottom up and i like your composition, though not really ''filled''I also wish it was a little more focused.  Mostly a good shot.', '2003-07-28 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
