(368595, 30614, 259, '<td valign="top">nice use of a shallow depth of field to bring out your subject.  probably the biggest problem with the picture, is the purple fringing.  it''s unfortunate that many digital cameras suffer from this.  however, you could have controled it by possibly recomposing the shot in such a way that you could avoid placing the branches over the sky.</td>', 'nice use of a shallow depth of field to bring out your subject.  probably the biggest problem with the picture, is the purple fringing.  it''s unfortunate that many digital cameras suffer from this.  however, you could have controled it by possibly recomposing the shot in such a way that you could avoid placing the branches over the sky.', '2003-07-28 13:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
