(369115, 30754, 9582, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. It''s hard to believe that anyone made me enjoy looking at any part of a church. Strong composition. The lighting is nice too...I like everything about this photo. (With the exception of it being a church) A 10 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful photo. It''s hard to believe that anyone made me enjoy looking at any part of a church. Strong composition. The lighting is nice too...I like everything about this photo. (With the exception of it being a church) A 10 from me!', '2003-07-28 22:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
