(369267, 30808, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the softness and the pink color, along with the water drops give this image a refreshing feel to it. I like what you have done here very much.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the softness and the pink color, along with the water drops give this image a refreshing feel to it. I like what you have done here very much.', '2003-07-29 03:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(369268, 30160, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man he looks evil! I saw these (or similar) gargoyles in Paris at the Notre Dame last month and the color is strikingly similar. Good job on filling both the frame and the challenge perfectly :-)</td>', 'Man he looks evil! I saw these (or similar) gargoyles in Paris at the Notre Dame last month and the color is strikingly similar. Good job on filling both the frame and the challenge perfectly :-)', '2003-07-29 03:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(369272, 30800, 5728, '<td valign="top">A simple but very succesful photo which immediately attracted my eye from the thumbnails. The way you have cropped it is particularly interesting with the button and the tag up in the top left hand corner. It''s very sharp but not too sharp, and the colors are spot on. Actually a very very good photo which meets the challenge in every way.</td>', 'A simple but very succesful photo which immediately attracted my eye from the thumbnails. The way you have cropped it is particularly interesting with the button and the tag up in the top left hand corner. It''s very sharp but not too sharp, and the colors are spot on. Actually a very very good photo which meets the challenge in every way.', '2003-07-29 03:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(369273, 30462, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is just absolutely beautiful!. The lighting set up you have is amazing and gives this such an unreal effect, I just love it!</td>', 'Now this is just absolutely beautiful!. The lighting set up you have is amazing and gives this such an unreal effect, I just love it!', '2003-07-29 03:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(369274, 30764, 5728, '<td valign="top">What a vivid and awesome green tonal range you''ve captured there. The textures are amazing, this is very good, very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'What a vivid and awesome green tonal range you''ve captured there. The textures are amazing, this is very good, very pleasing to the eye.', '2003-07-29 03:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(369275, 30575, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one. I''m not sure what they are but they make for a good photo, nice cropping - 8.</td>', 'Good one. I''m not sure what they are but they make for a good photo, nice cropping - 8.', '2003-07-29 03:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
