(369387, 30766, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Interesting composition.  I think I may have tried rotating it 45 degrees CW, but it looks fine as is.<br/>Technical: Nice focus, apart from far-right.  It looks a little oversharpened?  Nice colour and lighting.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: I think I''d have liked to see this in the Contrasts challenge.  Seems a little ''flat'' for this challenge.<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: Interesting composition.  I think I may have tried rotating it 45 degrees CW, but it looks fine as is.Technical: Nice focus, apart from far-right.  It looks a little oversharpened?  Nice colour and lighting.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: I think I''d have liked to see this in the Contrasts challenge.  Seems a little ''flat'' for this challenge. [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-07-29 08:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
