(369397, 30789, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Might have preferred the dog slightly further to the left.  Otherwise good.<br/>Technical: In colour I think you might not have got away with such a shallow DOF, but in B&amp;W the ''soft focus'' looks good.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Well done in a shot that''s hard to get right (especially for DPCers!)<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: Might have preferred the dog slightly further to the left.  Otherwise good.Technical: In colour I think you might not have got away with such a shallow DOF, but in B&W the ''soft focus'' looks good.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Well done in a shot that''s hard to get right (especially for DPCers!) [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-07-29 08:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
