(369520, 30742, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good! Well composed and focused, you have a good eye.</td>', 'This is good! Well composed and focused, you have a good eye.', '2003-07-29 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(369528, 30766, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at it for a while now but really can''t figure it out. What is it? Nice toning and compositon, I like it.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at it for a while now but really can''t figure it out. What is it? Nice toning and compositon, I like it.', '2003-07-29 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(369531, 30691, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective :-) I like the symmetry aspect. The natural skin tones come through well.</td>', 'Interesting perspective :-) I like the symmetry aspect. The natural skin tones come through well.', '2003-07-29 11:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(369533, 30813, 5728, '<td valign="top">Poor Lisa, why is she sad? Good idea for the challenge, however I think there is a little too much red tone throughout. Maybe tweaking the color balance in PS might have helped a little here.</td>', 'Poor Lisa, why is she sad? Good idea for the challenge, however I think there is a little too much red tone throughout. Maybe tweaking the color balance in PS might have helped a little here.', '2003-07-29 11:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(369534, 30541, 5728, '<td valign="top">Challenge met for sure. Somehow the yellow petals seem a little overexposed. After looking closely I detected that there are water droplets on the petals which you probably could have brought out more by tweaking the lightness and contrast.</td>', 'Challenge met for sure. Somehow the yellow petals seem a little overexposed. After looking closely I detected that there are water droplets on the petals which you probably could have brought out more by tweaking the lightness and contrast.', '2003-07-29 11:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(369535, 30750, 5728, '<td valign="top">A good focused cat portrait. The eyes are sharp and form the main focal point. The only thing which I would have changed is the lighting, the bottom part seems a little too dark compared to the top - 8.</td>', 'A good focused cat portrait. The eyes are sharp and form the main focal point. The only thing which I would have changed is the lighting, the bottom part seems a little too dark compared to the top - 8.', '2003-07-29 11:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(369537, 30715, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hi Duncan. Good on ya for filling the frame so well :-) Nice!</td>', 'Hi Duncan. Good on ya for filling the frame so well :-) Nice!', '2003-07-29 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(369538, 30635, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good original idea for the challenge. well done!</td>', 'This is a good original idea for the challenge. well done!', '2003-07-29 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(369550, 29960, 772, '<td valign="top">I have to say that this is probably the best cat photo I have seen on this site.  I love the composition you chose here... I can''t really offer you much in the way of a comment except that I love it :) = 10</td>', 'I have to say that this is probably the best cat photo I have seen on this site.  I love the composition you chose here... I can''t really offer you much in the way of a comment except that I love it :) = 10', '2003-07-29 12:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(369551, 30462, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful work.. the backlighting here was an excellent idea... great work :) = 10</td>', 'beautiful work.. the backlighting here was an excellent idea... great work :) = 10', '2003-07-29 12:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(369581, 30769, 5511, '<td valign="top">Ró yfir honum þessum....</td>', 'Ró yfir honum þessum....', '2003-07-29 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(369586, 30274, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition on this but I find the small wrinkles in the blue and the shadow in the lower left corner a bit distracting.</td>', 'I really like your composition on this but I find the small wrinkles in the blue and the shadow in the lower left corner a bit distracting.', '2003-07-29 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(369590, 30765, 5391, '<td valign="top">Perfection.  The use of backlight to bring out the perfectly focuses little thingies (for lack of a better word) in the center of the flower makes this leap off of the screen.  The rest of the flower almost feel like they''re melting out of it.  10</td>', 'Perfection.  The use of backlight to bring out the perfectly focuses little thingies (for lack of a better word) in the center of the flower makes this leap off of the screen.  The rest of the flower almost feel like they''re melting out of it.  10', '2003-07-29 13:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(369591, 30085, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject matter, well seen.  I think it could use a tiny bit of sharpening, but it''s lovely.</td>', 'Excellent subject matter, well seen.  I think it could use a tiny bit of sharpening, but it''s lovely.', '2003-07-29 13:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(369594, 30260, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nobody can accuse you of not taking the challenge literally.  Made me smile.  Photographically, it could use a little work on the focus and lighting, but you get an extra point from me on creativity.  :)</td>', 'Nobody can accuse you of not taking the challenge literally.  Made me smile.  Photographically, it could use a little work on the focus and lighting, but you get an extra point from me on creativity.  :)', '2003-07-29 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(369595, 30731, 5391, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  The centeredness works well here, as does the framing by the vines at the top of the frame.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  The centeredness works well here, as does the framing by the vines at the top of the frame.', '2003-07-29 13:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(369597, 30612, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good lighting, well seen.  I particularly like the arrangement and that it looks like you chose this specific spot out of a huge area.  I''d like to have seen it larger, but overall very nice.</td>', 'Nice shot, good lighting, well seen.  I particularly like the arrangement and that it looks like you chose this specific spot out of a huge area.  I''d like to have seen it larger, but overall very nice.', '2003-07-29 13:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(369599, 30794, 5391, '<td valign="top">Could stand to be sharper.  However, it''s a lovely subject and nice composition, as well as good exposure.</td>', 'Could stand to be sharper.  However, it''s a lovely subject and nice composition, as well as good exposure.', '2003-07-29 13:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(369600, 30667, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Someday I hope to be able to master black and white with my digital camera like this.  Excellent composition, spot-on focus.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Beautiful.  Someday I hope to be able to master black and white with my digital camera like this.  Excellent composition, spot-on focus.  Great job.  9', '2003-07-29 13:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(369604, 30799, 5391, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Great dynamics in a couple of ways - first, the triangle created by the men''s glasses; and second, the sloped lines all through the photo that point in the same way the men are looking.  DOF was used very well, the closest subject it tack-sharp and the others are blurred enough that they''re still definitely a large part of the image, but it adds depth to the shot.  The black and white tones are perfect throughout the entire image.  Just doesn''t get better than this.  10</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Great dynamics in a couple of ways - first, the triangle created by the men''s glasses; and second, the sloped lines all through the photo that point in the same way the men are looking.  DOF was used very well, the closest subject it tack-sharp and the others are blurred enough that they''re still definitely a large part of the image, but it adds depth to the shot.  The black and white tones are perfect throughout the entire image.  Just doesn''t get better than this.  10', '2003-07-29 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(369605, 30754, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I think this would work well as stock imagery.  Composition is very nice and I like the high contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I think this would work well as stock imagery.  Composition is very nice and I like the high contrast.', '2003-07-29 13:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(369608, 30293, 5391, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, interesting composition.  I like that you included the two doohickeys (my technical instrumental vocabulary is a bit lacking) at the bottom.  Color jumps off the screen at you, nice and sharp...  I''d be interested to see more outtakes from this shot - I can''t help but wonder if a diagonal tilt somehow would add to it...  But very nice as it is, that''s just a thought that crosses my mind.</td>', 'Great lighting, interesting composition.  I like that you included the two doohickeys (my technical instrumental vocabulary is a bit lacking) at the bottom.  Color jumps off the screen at you, nice and sharp...  I''d be interested to see more outtakes from this shot - I can''t help but wonder if a diagonal tilt somehow would add to it...  But very nice as it is, that''s just a thought that crosses my mind.', '2003-07-29 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(369609, 30714, 5391, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice.  So sharp and such fabulous texture captured in the pins.  The dof could be increased just a tiny bit so the whirly-gig on the pin on the right was also tack-sharp - I find it a tiny bit distracting.  Still really good, an 8.</td>', 'Really, really nice.  So sharp and such fabulous texture captured in the pins.  The dof could be increased just a tiny bit so the whirly-gig on the pin on the right was also tack-sharp - I find it a tiny bit distracting.  Still really good, an 8.', '2003-07-29 14:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(369611, 30623, 5391, '<td valign="top">It seems like your focus was right on, but either the flower was moving a tiny bit or you weren''t using a tripod, perhaps?  It seems like there''s a tiny amount of camera shake that''s distracting.  Other than that, it''s a creative angle and a beautiful subject, and you did a great job filling the frame.</td>', 'It seems like your focus was right on, but either the flower was moving a tiny bit or you weren''t using a tripod, perhaps?  It seems like there''s a tiny amount of camera shake that''s distracting.  Other than that, it''s a creative angle and a beautiful subject, and you did a great job filling the frame.', '2003-07-29 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(369612, 30462, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - it looks as though the sun is literally coming out of the flower and shining on the stamens.  Totally awesome lighting job and composition.  The yellow on the brightly lit stamens is a tiny bit oversaturated, which takes away some detail from the part of the subject that my eye is really drawn to.  If there was just a bit more detail there, this would be a 10.  Still, an amazing and inspiring shot.  8</td>', 'Wow - it looks as though the sun is literally coming out of the flower and shining on the stamens.  Totally awesome lighting job and composition.  The yellow on the brightly lit stamens is a tiny bit oversaturated, which takes away some detail from the part of the subject that my eye is really drawn to.  If there was just a bit more detail there, this would be a 10.  Still, an amazing and inspiring shot.  8', '2003-07-29 14:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(369615, 30180, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting.  Really brings the subject to life.</td>', 'Lovely lighting.  Really brings the subject to life.', '2003-07-29 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(369619, 30684, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like the folks that had fun with the literal interpretation of "fill the frame" - an extra point for creativity.  This is a really beautiful shot, the lighting works perfectly for b/w and I like the tilted composition a lot - it adds even more visual interest.  I get the feeling that the front of the frame is angled a bit away from me, and I''d like it maybe to be angled more towards me - just a tiny thing that hangs in the back of my mind when I look at this.  But overall I think you did a beautiful job.  9</td>', 'I really like the folks that had fun with the literal interpretation of "fill the frame" - an extra point for creativity.  This is a really beautiful shot, the lighting works perfectly for b/w and I like the tilted composition a lot - it adds even more visual interest.  I get the feeling that the front of the frame is angled a bit away from me, and I''d like it maybe to be angled more towards me - just a tiny thing that hangs in the back of my mind when I look at this.  But overall I think you did a beautiful job.  9', '2003-07-29 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(369623, 30280, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice architectural shot. love the diagonal composition and perspective.</td>', 'nice architectural shot. love the diagonal composition and perspective.', '2003-07-29 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(369624, 30342, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful cityscape.  I think you filled the frame superbly.  I particularly like the bottom half because the tones are so nice, but the contrast seems to fade for some reason towards the top of the image...  I know dodging and burning in the challenges isn''t allowed, so I''m not going to mark you down for that, at least you didn''t cheat and try to spot edit.  Great composition, really invokes the feeling of city life.  And I think the black and white adds a lot to that feel as well.  8</td>', 'Wonderful cityscape.  I think you filled the frame superbly.  I particularly like the bottom half because the tones are so nice, but the contrast seems to fade for some reason towards the top of the image...  I know dodging and burning in the challenges isn''t allowed, so I''m not going to mark you down for that, at least you didn''t cheat and try to spot edit.  Great composition, really invokes the feeling of city life.  And I think the black and white adds a lot to that feel as well.  8', '2003-07-29 14:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(369625, 30667, 9027, '<td valign="top">well composed bw shot. love the chrome and overall transparency/reflectivity.</td>', 'well composed bw shot. love the chrome and overall transparency/reflectivity.', '2003-07-29 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(369626, 30132, 9027, '<td valign="top">wow! what a great closeup. very crisp. it looks like he is intently chomping away. hehe</td>', 'wow! what a great closeup. very crisp. it looks like he is intently chomping away. hehe', '2003-07-29 14:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(369627, 30565, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Very cool subject matter.  I''m not sure that you needed to include so many in the shot - perhaps a close up of one with several others blurred by depth of field might have worked better photographically, but I see where you were going by your title, making it look like a huge forest of the buggers...  I think you accomplished that pretty well.</td>', 'Wow.  Very cool subject matter.  I''m not sure that you needed to include so many in the shot - perhaps a close up of one with several others blurred by depth of field might have worked better photographically, but I see where you were going by your title, making it look like a huge forest of the buggers...  I think you accomplished that pretty well.', '2003-07-29 14:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(369628, 30586, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the wet look and feel and the overall sharpness.  Highlights are a little harsh, perhaps.  I might have tried a more diffused lighting to really make the colors pop.   7</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the wet look and feel and the overall sharpness.  Highlights are a little harsh, perhaps.  I might have tried a more diffused lighting to really make the colors pop.   7', '2003-07-29 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(369629, 30789, 5391, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful...  I''m such a sucker for dog pictures, and this one is done very well, both they eyes and the nose are all in focus very well, and it''s almost like I can feel the softness of the fur on his neck.  8</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful...  I''m such a sucker for dog pictures, and this one is done very well, both they eyes and the nose are all in focus very well, and it''s almost like I can feel the softness of the fur on his neck.  8', '2003-07-29 14:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(369630, 30714, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice shot. love the texture and bw contrast. i like how it directs you toward the focus area, but do wish the protruding pin was also in focus. the thumbnail shot definitely caught my eye. good job.</td>', 'nice shot. love the texture and bw contrast. i like how it directs you toward the focus area, but do wish the protruding pin was also in focus. the thumbnail shot definitely caught my eye. good job.', '2003-07-29 14:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(369631, 30280, 5391, '<td valign="top">Disturbing angle, very effective.  I like how much of the building you''ve encompassed in the frame.  Makes it seem ominous.  Nice tones, too.  The fact that they lean towards the dark side works very well with the mood.  8</td>', 'Disturbing angle, very effective.  I like how much of the building you''ve encompassed in the frame.  Makes it seem ominous.  Nice tones, too.  The fact that they lean towards the dark side works very well with the mood.  8', '2003-07-29 14:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(369636, 30079, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject.  Some nice side lighting would really bring out the textures.  I think I would have cropped out the little distraction in the upper right hand corner - it''s competing for my attention with the subject.  Congrats on trying an abstract image, I think we need more of them around here!</td>', 'Lovely subject.  Some nice side lighting would really bring out the textures.  I think I would have cropped out the little distraction in the upper right hand corner - it''s competing for my attention with the subject.  Congrats on trying an abstract image, I think we need more of them around here!', '2003-07-29 14:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(369637, 30766, 5391, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous abstract.  Great lines, textures, composition, tones...  What more can I say?  9</td>', 'Gorgeous abstract.  Great lines, textures, composition, tones...  What more can I say?  9', '2003-07-29 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(369647, 30226, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow.  Beautiful.  The warm wood colors contrast so nicely with the b/w, and the sign really makes this "pop".  Has an "old-west" feeling to it.  Also somewhat of a soft-focus effect or something that makes it feel a bit dreamy.  I think a print of this would do well on the market in my area of western Montana.  9</td>', 'Oh, wow.  Beautiful.  The warm wood colors contrast so nicely with the b/w, and the sign really makes this "pop".  Has an "old-west" feeling to it.  Also somewhat of a soft-focus effect or something that makes it feel a bit dreamy.  I think a print of this would do well on the market in my area of western Montana.  9', '2003-07-29 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(369651, 30590, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Nice colors, textures and composition.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Nice colors, textures and composition.', '2003-07-29 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(369652, 30763, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is hysterical!  I can''t vote so I was just glancing through the thumbnails and saw this one just staring back at me. I had to laugh.  Good job on the photo, even better on the fun-factor. Thanks for the giggle.</td>', 'This is hysterical!  I can''t vote so I was just glancing through the thumbnails and saw this one just staring back at me. I had to laugh.  Good job on the photo, even better on the fun-factor. Thanks for the giggle.', '2003-07-29 15:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(369654, 30711, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of the loveliest flower shots I have seen on the sight. The soft focus and lack of color give it an elegant feel.  The lighting brings out texture of the petals and adds a nice depth to the center. If I could vote, you''d have a 10 from me.</td>', 'This is one of the loveliest flower shots I have seen on the sight. The soft focus and lack of color give it an elegant feel.  The lighting brings out texture of the petals and adds a nice depth to the center. If I could vote, you''d have a 10 from me.', '2003-07-29 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(369655, 30742, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge. I like that you were able to capture the tree in such a way that it gives the illusion of being something else. From the "eye" to the "tusk", I can see the elephant in there in the same way one might look at a cloud formation and see an angel or something else.  The textures of the bark are interesting, making me want to linger on the photo for a closer examination. It also fits the challenge very well (as I interpret it).  If I could vote, you''d have a 10 from me.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge. I like that you were able to capture the tree in such a way that it gives the illusion of being something else. From the "eye" to the "tusk", I can see the elephant in there in the same way one might look at a cloud formation and see an angel or something else.  The textures of the bark are interesting, making me want to linger on the photo for a closer examination. It also fits the challenge very well (as I interpret it).  If I could vote, you''d have a 10 from me.', '2003-07-29 15:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(369659, 30195, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of the best cat shots I''ve seen.  Nicely cropped and focused.  He (she?) is a beautiful subject well captured.</td>', 'One of the best cat shots I''ve seen.  Nicely cropped and focused.  He (she?) is a beautiful subject well captured.', '2003-07-29 15:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(369660, 30715, 9295, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photo.  You captured him with just the perfect expression on his face. A true "Kodak Moment".  I''m not a photographer myself with expertise on lighting, focus, exposure, etc...but as a mother, I can tell you this is a keeper.  Just charming.</td>', 'I absolutely love this photo.  You captured him with just the perfect expression on his face. A true "Kodak Moment".  I''m not a photographer myself with expertise on lighting, focus, exposure, etc...but as a mother, I can tell you this is a keeper.  Just charming.', '2003-07-29 15:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(369667, 30667, 9131, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  a little less centered wold be better in my opinion.  nice depth.</td>', 'nice shot.  a little less centered wold be better in my opinion.  nice depth.', '2003-07-29 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(369668, 30766, 9131, '<td valign="top">a feather?  cool!</td>', 'a feather?  cool!', '2003-07-29 15:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(369669, 30657, 9131, '<td valign="top">very nice light.  i like the darkness of the shot, it makes it powerful.</td>', 'very nice light.  i like the darkness of the shot, it makes it powerful.', '2003-07-29 15:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(369670, 30780, 9131, '<td valign="top">nice shot! go arizona!!</td>', 'nice shot! go arizona!!', '2003-07-29 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(369675, 29960, 9131, '<td valign="top">good shot.  there have been many cat shots, and this is the best so far! i like the curled paws...</td>', 'good shot.  there have been many cat shots, and this is the best so far! i like the curled paws...', '2003-07-29 15:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(369677, 30630, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Great use of repetition and nice dynamic composition to keep it interesting to the eye.  8</td>', 'Very cool.  Great use of repetition and nice dynamic composition to keep it interesting to the eye.  8', '2003-07-29 16:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(369679, 30769, 5391, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and lighting.  Beautiful picture.<br/> <br/>Had to come back for a 2nd look...  This is just beautiful!  9</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and lighting.  Beautiful picture. Had to come back for a 2nd look...  This is just beautiful!  9', '2003-07-29 16:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(369680, 30525, 7350, '<td valign="top">A bit noisy.  Perhaps NeatImage could have cleaned this up a little.</td>', 'A bit noisy.  Perhaps NeatImage could have cleaned this up a little.', '2003-07-29 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(369681, 29978, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The darkness provides sort of a somber mood though - I''m not sure that''s what you''re going for here.  The composition is perfect.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The darkness provides sort of a somber mood though - I''m not sure that''s what you''re going for here.  The composition is perfect.', '2003-07-29 16:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(369682, 30226, 7350, '<td valign="top">Leaving the brown here was an interesting choice.  I''m not sure how you did it - was the barn completely green or something?</td>', 'Leaving the brown here was an interesting choice.  I''m not sure how you did it - was the barn completely green or something?', '2003-07-29 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
