(370097, 30041, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very difficult shot. I think the mid tones and shadows are great. The brights are over bright  in my opinion, and cause loss of detail. I wish the digital sensors had a wider range.</td>', 'Very difficult shot. I think the mid tones and shadows are great. The brights are over bright  in my opinion, and cause loss of detail. I wish the digital sensors had a wider range.', '2003-07-30 00:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
