(370101, 30571, 6325, '<td valign="top">Havin the person in the image is a good touch. Tones are good representing a wide range. Very difficult to see much with all the detail - wish I could see a big image.</td>', 'Havin the person in the image is a good touch. Tones are good representing a wide range. Very difficult to see much with all the detail - wish I could see a big image.', '2003-07-30 01:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
