(370295, 30774, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love the color and texture of this shot.  I wold have cropped out the dark spot (corner) on the left however, and about an inch off of the right also.</td>', 'Love the color and texture of this shot.  I wold have cropped out the dark spot (corner) on the left however, and about an inch off of the right also.', '2003-07-30 02:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(370297, 30804, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup but, you should always zoom out a tiny bit and then DO crop when needed. :)  That could help here by giving you the full word "coins" on the right and show the wording on the left as well.  As it is, those mistakes are distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice closeup but, you should always zoom out a tiny bit and then DO crop when needed. :)  That could help here by giving you the full word "coins" on the right and show the wording on the left as well.  As it is, those mistakes are distracting to me.', '2003-07-30 02:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(370298, 30490, 4494, '<td valign="top">That''s very cool.  I like the amount of brick you left in the shot, contrasted with the light from the side and the painting inside.  Nice one!!  8.</td>', 'That''s very cool.  I like the amount of brick you left in the shot, contrasted with the light from the side and the painting inside.  Nice one!!  8.', '2003-07-30 02:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(370299, 30780, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the tone of the picture, which I think was created by the extreme angle of the sun.  You must have gone crazy trying to decide how to crop this one! :D  Good job.</td>', 'Wow, I really like the tone of the picture, which I think was created by the extreme angle of the sun.  You must have gone crazy trying to decide how to crop this one! :D  Good job.', '2003-07-30 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(370304, 30722, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like the "funky" blue background below the strings, it really looks good in this shot.  I think you should have used slightly more DOF if possible and focused more on the front/middle (instead of the middle).    Good job!</td>', 'I like the "funky" blue background below the strings, it really looks good in this shot.  I think you should have used slightly more DOF if possible and focused more on the front/middle (instead of the middle).    Good job!', '2003-07-30 02:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(370305, 29978, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I really like the B&amp;W here...  However I would have cropped out the father''s left shoulder.  Hmm, now I look again, that would remove the nice white ribbon. :(</td>', 'Nice shot, I really like the B&W here...  However I would have cropped out the father''s left shoulder.  Hmm, now I look again, that would remove the nice white ribbon. :(', '2003-07-30 02:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
