(373236, 30571, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the feel of this picture.  it reminds me of new york.  for fill the frame it''s not one of my favorite shots, but as a picture in it''s own right aside from the challenge it is.</td>', 'i really like the feel of this picture.  it reminds me of new york.  for fill the frame it''s not one of my favorite shots, but as a picture in it''s own right aside from the challenge it is.', '2003-08-01 02:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
