(373241, 30798, 259, '<td valign="top">the focus is very nice.  one recommendation i would have would have been to use all different colored tacks.  they would have added another dimension of interest to the overall composition.</td>', 'the focus is very nice.  one recommendation i would have would have been to use all different colored tacks.  they would have added another dimension of interest to the overall composition.', '2003-08-01 02:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(373248, 30176, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the picture and the choice of duotone.  the texture in the jeans is great.  the one thing that would greatly improve your overall presentation is having a boarder that is even on all sides.  the right side is smaller than the left.  the picture is very nice, however,  the presentation could be improved.</td>', 'i really like the picture and the choice of duotone.  the texture in the jeans is great.  the one thing that would greatly improve your overall presentation is having a boarder that is even on all sides.  the right side is smaller than the left.  the picture is very nice, however,  the presentation could be improved.', '2003-08-01 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(373250, 30724, 259, '<td valign="top">the jet is filling the frame from each of it''s tips, but there is probably more sky showing in total area than the jet.</td>', 'the jet is filling the frame from each of it''s tips, but there is probably more sky showing in total area than the jet.', '2003-08-01 03:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(373256, 30719, 259, '<td valign="top">two things that could really help your picture are: one, better lighting, and two a more interesting subject.  the overall picture is a tad dark, but not so dark you can''t tell what''s going on.  a little more lighting or a better lighting angle would bring out more detail in the pasta.  as far as the subject, something with more color variation would be more eye catching and appealing to the viewer.  there are some peas and corn in the shot, but really the corn is in the same general shade as the pasta and there aren''t that many peas overall.<br/> <br/>those are just some of the things i have learned over the couple of years on this site that have helped me take better pictures gradually over time.</td>', 'two things that could really help your picture are: one, better lighting, and two a more interesting subject.  the overall picture is a tad dark, but not so dark you can''t tell what''s going on.  a little more lighting or a better lighting angle would bring out more detail in the pasta.  as far as the subject, something with more color variation would be more eye catching and appealing to the viewer.  there are some peas and corn in the shot, but really the corn is in the same general shade as the pasta and there aren''t that many peas overall. those are just some of the things i have learned over the couple of years on this site that have helped me take better pictures gradually over time.', '2003-08-01 03:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(373261, 30580, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and detailed. Are these erasers or candy? Challenge is definitely met here.</td>', 'Very colorful and detailed. Are these erasers or candy? Challenge is definitely met here.', '2003-08-01 03:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(373262, 30085, 5728, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little soft here, but you''ve met the challenge for sure.</td>', 'The focus seems a little soft here, but you''ve met the challenge for sure.', '2003-08-01 03:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(373265, 30620, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good pic! It looks kind of like a skull imbedded into the tree trunk. (Guess I''m not the first to mention that tho huh?)</td>', 'Good pic! It looks kind of like a skull imbedded into the tree trunk. (Guess I''m not the first to mention that tho huh?)', '2003-08-01 03:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
