(373281, 30755, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, good submission. The only thing I could really comment on is that I would have prefered to see the whole flower sharp, the green at the front is burry. A higher aperture number would have taken care of this.</td>', 'Lovely colors, good submission. The only thing I could really comment on is that I would have prefered to see the whole flower sharp, the green at the front is burry. A higher aperture number would have taken care of this.', '2003-08-01 03:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
