(373431, 30740, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good motion blur, except at the bottom where the blur looks like a smear across the image. Somehow it doesn''t fit in with the top part. The composition is good however and the lighting not blown out at all.</td>', 'Good motion blur, except at the bottom where the blur looks like a smear across the image. Somehow it doesn''t fit in with the top part. The composition is good however and the lighting not blown out at all.', '2003-08-01 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(373434, 30260, 5728, '<td valign="top">Aha a literal meaning to the challenge :-) Although I personally wouldn''t have cropped it like you have. I wouldn''t have left the space above the frame, rather I would have tried to put the flag (?) inside the frame and crop the top part out.</td>', 'Aha a literal meaning to the challenge :-) Although I personally wouldn''t have cropped it like you have. I wouldn''t have left the space above the frame, rather I would have tried to put the flag (?) inside the frame and crop the top part out.', '2003-08-01 07:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(373435, 30657, 5728, '<td valign="top">Challenge met for sure. Only there is a little too much light glare from the nose and the area above the eye.</td>', 'Challenge met for sure. Only there is a little too much light glare from the nose and the area above the eye.', '2003-08-01 07:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
