(373632, 30691, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not very flattering... mainly down to the yellow colour cast. The glasses and nose are either not blurred enough, or not clear enough... either way, it needs to look more deliberate. Other than that, humourous picture, very cheeky! The black in the top corners works well. 6</td>', 'Not very flattering... mainly down to the yellow colour cast. The glasses and nose are either not blurred enough, or not clear enough... either way, it needs to look more deliberate. Other than that, humourous picture, very cheeky! The black in the top corners works well. 6', '2003-08-01 13:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(373651, 30586, 3290, '<td valign="top">Attractive subject, quite nicely shot. Looks a little soft, but I think that''s the texture of the cherry surface, rather than really being off. Might have more impact pulled back a bit, so we can see more cherries?</td>', 'Attractive subject, quite nicely shot. Looks a little soft, but I think that''s the texture of the cherry surface, rather than really being off. Might have more impact pulled back a bit, so we can see more cherries?', '2003-08-01 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
