(373845, 30551, 6771, '<td valign="top">This would work much better with a bit more overall lighting.  Is harsh on the eagles and then the lighting gets muddy all the way around the edges.  I think it may have worked better getting in a bit closer.</td>', 'This would work much better with a bit more overall lighting.  Is harsh on the eagles and then the lighting gets muddy all the way around the edges.  I think it may have worked better getting in a bit closer.', '2003-08-01 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(373847, 30719, 6771, '<td valign="top">The lighting and colr gets muddy along the left bottom corner.  the focus is a little soft.  Gut wise, the shot doesn''t really grab me, the pastas color is kind of unappealing to me</td>', 'The lighting and colr gets muddy along the left bottom corner.  the focus is a little soft.  Gut wise, the shot doesn''t really grab me, the pastas color is kind of unappealing to me', '2003-08-01 18:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
