(373866, 30169, 6771, '<td valign="top">I did something similar to this in black and white on a badger skull.  Did not do that great.  How about a high key B&amp;W?  Not too fond of the red.  Great focus at the "suture" line</td>', 'I did something similar to this in black and white on a badger skull.  Did not do that great.  How about a high key B&W?  Not too fond of the red.  Great focus at the "suture" line', '2003-08-01 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
