(374112, 30672, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastel colors.  My only nitpick would be the area of the candy that is flattened.  The continuity is broken.  I think it would be better if the candy was turned to see just the curves.  It''s only my humble opinion.  Overall I like the composition, colouring, and texture.</td>', 'Lovely pastel colors.  My only nitpick would be the area of the candy that is flattened.  The continuity is broken.  I think it would be better if the candy was turned to see just the curves.  It''s only my humble opinion.  Overall I like the composition, colouring, and texture.', '2003-08-02 00:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
