(374543, 30579, 806, '<td valign="top">excellent idea and execution. makes for a great abstract! bravo!</td>', 'excellent idea and execution. makes for a great abstract! bravo!', '2003-08-02 15:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(374558, 30590, 4967, '<td valign="top">OOOHHH... I love snakes :-)  I had a corn snake for a while, and before that a fox snake... they are beautiful creatures, and definitely NOT slimey :-)  Your photo has a lot of glare, and the woodchips are quite burned out.  I think I would have liked to see the head in there, and maybe, coiled so you didn''t see the background, to more effectively fill the frame.  Doing this if possible in direct sunlight without the flash might have been better.</td>', 'OOOHHH... I love snakes :-)  I had a corn snake for a while, and before that a fox snake... they are beautiful creatures, and definitely NOT slimey :-)  Your photo has a lot of glare, and the woodchips are quite burned out.  I think I would have liked to see the head in there, and maybe, coiled so you didn''t see the background, to more effectively fill the frame.  Doing this if possible in direct sunlight without the flash might have been better.', '2003-08-02 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(374560, 30003, 4967, '<td valign="top">I hope this is used for marijuana only ;-)  Hehehe... pipes can be really beautiful pieces of art truly.  Interesting way to fill the frame so that you can''t really tell at first glance what this is.  The glare from the lights is kind of annoying though... this is almost too busy.</td>', 'I hope this is used for marijuana only ;-)  Hehehe... pipes can be really beautiful pieces of art truly.  Interesting way to fill the frame so that you can''t really tell at first glance what this is.  The glare from the lights is kind of annoying though... this is almost too busy.', '2003-08-02 16:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(374590, 30651, 6388, '<td valign="top">don''t listen to those people who tell you this is too grainy or contrasty. it looks fantastic like that.  very nice image.  don''t know if it''s possible or not (not sure how much zoom was involved) but a fill flash would light this guy''s up beautifully.  As it stands, they''re a little shadowy.  This better score well.</td>', 'don''t listen to those people who tell you this is too grainy or contrasty. it looks fantastic like that.  very nice image.  don''t know if it''s possible or not (not sure how much zoom was involved) but a fill flash would light this guy''s up beautifully.  As it stands, they''re a little shadowy.  This better score well.', '2003-08-02 16:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(374591, 30691, 6388, '<td valign="top">yow. hot picture.  love the depth - nice and crisp onthe ''subject'' with a little blur on the nose and J-Lo glasses.  a wee bit off centre on the face, but that''s tough when you''re looking down to be sure it''s from straight above.  nice job</td>', 'yow. hot picture.  love the depth - nice and crisp onthe ''subject'' with a little blur on the nose and J-Lo glasses.  a wee bit off centre on the face, but that''s tough when you''re looking down to be sure it''s from straight above.  nice job', '2003-08-02 16:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(374592, 30641, 6388, '<td valign="top">fun shot.  995 still impresses me with the depth it can get with that little lens.  one of my favourite cams I''ve ever had.  the graininess works.  i would have liked to see that top corner of the LCD cropped off so i couldn''t see the rounded edge.  hard to get all verticals with this perspective, and cropping helps.  nice shot.</td>', 'fun shot.  995 still impresses me with the depth it can get with that little lens.  one of my favourite cams I''ve ever had.  the graininess works.  i would have liked to see that top corner of the LCD cropped off so i couldn''t see the rounded edge.  hard to get all verticals with this perspective, and cropping helps.  nice shot.', '2003-08-02 16:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(374594, 30799, 6388, '<td valign="top">hell yes.  myfavourite image so far.  I really like this. i can''t tell if it''s posed or not, which is one of the things i love about it.  don''t listen to the anal-retentives who tell you it''s not filling the frame.  I''ll be watching to see how this places.  it better be high.  great depth, nice ambient light.  I like that you metered to the guys inthe back, muting the front face a bit.</td>', 'hell yes.  myfavourite image so far.  I really like this. i can''t tell if it''s posed or not, which is one of the things i love about it.  don''t listen to the anal-retentives who tell you it''s not filling the frame.  I''ll be watching to see how this places.  it better be high.  great depth, nice ambient light.  I like that you metered to the guys inthe back, muting the front face a bit.', '2003-08-02 16:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
