(374775, 30588, 7711, '<td valign="top">this isn''t what I''d traditionally think of as "fill the frame" but I don''t think it fails to meet the challenge. However, I think its really missing a strong point of interest. The skyline just isn''t popping against your sky..its oclours are nice, but not strong enough to really force the image to fly out at us. :)</td>', 'this isn''t what I''d traditionally think of as "fill the frame" but I don''t think it fails to meet the challenge. However, I think its really missing a strong point of interest. The skyline just isn''t popping against your sky..its oclours are nice, but not strong enough to really force the image to fly out at us. :)', '2003-08-02 21:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
