(374786, 30620, 7711, '<td valign="top">I really like that shape in the centre, I woul have cropped off the bottom to let that particular abstract fill the frame, but this is still really cool. You have captured details and textures well, and I like the focus too.</td>', 'I really like that shape in the centre, I woul have cropped off the bottom to let that particular abstract fill the frame, but this is still really cool. You have captured details and textures well, and I like the focus too.', '2003-08-02 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(374793, 30557, 7711, '<td valign="top">great catchlights in the eyes! What method did you use to make this bw? Whatever method it was, it seems to have taken away a lot of the contrast in the shot. I would have liked a bit more tonal range, but that''s a nit. Nice shot for sure!</td>', 'great catchlights in the eyes! What method did you use to make this bw? Whatever method it was, it seems to have taken away a lot of the contrast in the shot. I would have liked a bit more tonal range, but that''s a nit. Nice shot for sure!', '2003-08-02 21:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(374836, 30132, 6325, '<td valign="top">What an stunning image. The affinity to humankind is startling. The photographic elements are impecible.</td>', 'What an stunning image. The affinity to humankind is startling. The photographic elements are impecible.', '2003-08-02 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
