(374963, 30740, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I like the position of the centre part to the right.  I think I would have tried to fill the frame with the lights rather than leaving the slightly dark bottom part.<br/>Technical: Nice exposure.  Seems very slightly blurred on the fixed objects, I guess this may have been handheld?<br/>Meets challenge: Not sure..<br/>Overall impression: Nice idea, composition could tidy up the photo I think.<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: I like the position of the centre part to the right.  I think I would have tried to fill the frame with the lights rather than leaving the slightly dark bottom part.Technical: Nice exposure.  Seems very slightly blurred on the fixed objects, I guess this may have been handheld?Meets challenge: Not sure..Overall impression: Nice idea, composition could tidy up the photo I think. [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-08-03 05:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
