(374984, 30226, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Interesting composition.  There isn''t one main focal point, which some viewers may not like.  For me it adds to the interest of the photo as a whole.<br/>Technical: Nice colour and contrast.  The b&amp;w wall looks surprisingly good against the wooden door/windows.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Very nice photo.  Well done.<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: Interesting composition.  There isn''t one main focal point, which some viewers may not like.  For me it adds to the interest of the photo as a whole.Technical: Nice colour and contrast.  The b&w wall looks surprisingly good against the wooden door/windows.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Very nice photo.  Well done. [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-08-03 05:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(374985, 30764, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour and texture. You''ve chosen a good section for your focus, although it does look slightly soft towards the top. [7]</td>', 'Lovely colour and texture. You''ve chosen a good section for your focus, although it does look slightly soft towards the top. [7]', '2003-08-03 05:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(374986, 30160, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: Nice composition and cropping.<br/>Technical: I like the focus and colourisation.  Did you try a b&amp;w?  I think the border is a little thick and darkens the photo unnecessarily.  Don''t forget DPC adds a 1px black border, making yours slightly thicker.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Nice amount of detail and interesting subject.<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: Nice composition and cropping.Technical: I like the focus and colourisation.  Did you try a b&w?  I think the border is a little thick and darkens the photo unnecessarily.  Don''t forget DPC adds a 1px black border, making yours slightly thicker.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Nice amount of detail and interesting subject. [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-08-03 05:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(374987, 30623, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I would have preferred the flower centre to be on the top-right third intersection.<br/>Technical: Unfortunately the eye is instantly drawn to the flower centre, which is slightly out of focus.<br/>Meets challenge: Some people may mark you do for being able to see a background.<br/>Overall impression: Nice subject, but somewhat lacking technically.<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: I would have preferred the flower centre to be on the top-right third intersection.Technical: Unfortunately the eye is instantly drawn to the flower centre, which is slightly out of focus.Meets challenge: Some people may mark you do for being able to see a background.Overall impression: Nice subject, but somewhat lacking technically. [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-08-03 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(374988, 30725, 669, '<td valign="top">Composition: I''m not too keen on the point of view.  If it was possible to get a show without reflections I think it would be better square-on to the cans.<br/>Technical: Focus seems slightly off.<br/>Meets challenge: Yes<br/>Overall impression: Composition greatly affects the image, which I''m not too keen on personally.<br/> <br/>[ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]</td>', 'Composition: I''m not too keen on the point of view.  If it was possible to get a show without reflections I think it would be better square-on to the cans.Technical: Focus seems slightly off.Meets challenge: YesOverall impression: Composition greatly affects the image, which I''m not too keen on personally. [ If this style of comment is useful, please leave a few yourself!  www.calcaria.net/dpc.html ]', '2003-08-03 05:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(374989, 29960, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this after voting earlier and I''ve just upgraded it to a [9] - mainly because there is actually little wrong with it. It''s crisp, it''s a beautiful study, a great pose and it fills the frame. I do think the only improvement could be losing the double border and an increased DOF to get everything slightly sharper. Excellent - and you''ve got a lovely cat too.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this after voting earlier and I''ve just upgraded it to a [9] - mainly because there is actually little wrong with it. It''s crisp, it''s a beautiful study, a great pose and it fills the frame. I do think the only improvement could be losing the double border and an increased DOF to get everything slightly sharper. Excellent - and you''ve got a lovely cat too.', '2003-08-03 05:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(374991, 30693, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great shot - which could be improved only by increased DOF and clarity. [7]</td>', 'Great shot - which could be improved only by increased DOF and clarity. [7]', '2003-08-03 05:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(374992, 30541, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great shot and focus. I would have cropped out the gappy petals though as they are distracting from the dynamics. Good DOF. [7]</td>', 'Great shot and focus. I would have cropped out the gappy petals though as they are distracting from the dynamics. Good DOF. [7]', '2003-08-03 05:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(374993, 30713, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot, which could have been slightly improved with less flat light and a faster shutter speed. This would have ''cleaned up'' the areas of slight motion that cause some parts to look slightly blurred or soft. [7]</td>', 'Intriguing shot, which could have been slightly improved with less flat light and a faster shutter speed. This would have ''cleaned up'' the areas of slight motion that cause some parts to look slightly blurred or soft. [7]', '2003-08-03 06:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(374994, 30565, 8860, '<td valign="top">Healthy looking Venus fly trap! Very juicy. It''s a good shot but slightly lacks atmosphere due to flat lighting. Shooting this early or late in the day may have added more drama. [7]</td>', 'Healthy looking Venus fly trap! Very juicy. It''s a good shot but slightly lacks atmosphere due to flat lighting. Shooting this early or late in the day may have added more drama. [7]', '2003-08-03 06:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(374995, 30687, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent snapshot of someone''s life really! There must be so many freezers like this one - my mother-in-law''s is very similar! Good focus and clarity and a nice study - Aardman animations would be proud of you... [8]</td>', 'This is an excellent snapshot of someone''s life really! There must be so many freezers like this one - my mother-in-law''s is very similar! Good focus and clarity and a nice study - Aardman animations would be proud of you... [8]', '2003-08-03 06:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(374998, 30714, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture and lighting. I find it just slightly frustrating that the peg on the right is losing focus due to DOF. Great shot and a creative take on the challenge. [8]</td>', 'Lovely texture and lighting. I find it just slightly frustrating that the peg on the right is losing focus due to DOF. Great shot and a creative take on the challenge. [8]', '2003-08-03 06:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(374999, 30765, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite the numerous (and quite tiresome!) flower shots this one does stand out. Smooth tones and a nice viewpoint with great DOF.  [8]</td>', 'Despite the numerous (and quite tiresome!) flower shots this one does stand out. Smooth tones and a nice viewpoint with great DOF.  [8]', '2003-08-03 06:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(375003, 30085, 8860, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft and lighting a bit flat. Nice shot otherwise. [6]</td>', 'Focus is a little soft and lighting a bit flat. Nice shot otherwise. [6]', '2003-08-03 06:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
