(375044, 30152, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition, but a bit too soft focus. I can''t discern what is covering the eye of the girl on the right and wonder if it''s relevant in some way (because it''s in the shot). I like the expressions on the faces - lighting is a bit too flat - contrast is OK but the border is a bit overpowering. [5]</td>', 'This is an interesting composition, but a bit too soft focus. I can''t discern what is covering the eye of the girl on the right and wonder if it''s relevant in some way (because it''s in the shot). I like the expressions on the faces - lighting is a bit too flat - contrast is OK but the border is a bit overpowering. [5]', '2003-08-03 07:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(375048, 30600, 8860, '<td valign="top">DOF is too narrow to make this suit your title perfectly. By keeping them ALL in focus you would give even more feeling of perpetuation ''where does one finish and the other begin?''. You should also have repositioned to avoid the top corner of white which shows that, actually,  they''re ''not everywhere''! [4]</td>', 'DOF is too narrow to make this suit your title perfectly. By keeping them ALL in focus you would give even more feeling of perpetuation ''where does one finish and the other begin?''. You should also have repositioned to avoid the top corner of white which shows that, actually,  they''re ''not everywhere''! [4]', '2003-08-03 07:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(375051, 30702, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great composition - good pattern - intriguing subject - nice colours. Focus on top pages looks a bit blurry and the pink line to the right is distracting. Good treatment for challenge. [7]</td>', 'Great composition - good pattern - intriguing subject - nice colours. Focus on top pages looks a bit blurry and the pink line to the right is distracting. Good treatment for challenge. [7]', '2003-08-03 07:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
