(375104, 30775, 7857, '<td valign="top">Is it a moth? Very hard to tell. Technically an excellent shot, I like the colours and you''ve got a nice combination with the DOF and the shard detail on the left side. Good job, look forward to finding out what it is.</td>', 'Is it a moth? Very hard to tell. Technically an excellent shot, I like the colours and you''ve got a nice combination with the DOF and the shard detail on the left side. Good job, look forward to finding out what it is.', '2003-08-03 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(375105, 30525, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I wonder why u didn''t fill the frame as the challenge said?  Queen Anne''s Lace is a fine subject. Good exposure, focus, etc.</td>', 'Very nice!  I wonder why u didn''t fill the frame as the challenge said?  Queen Anne''s Lace is a fine subject. Good exposure, focus, etc.', '2003-08-03 09:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(375108, 30763, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2003-08-03 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(375146, 30710, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject. Excellent detail, and I love the color tones. I do wonder if you took shots from other angles and settled in on this as a final choice. The crop is a little tight for my taste, I''d like to see more of this photogenic creature in the shot. I don''t like the tiny tan key-line border on this because it almost looks like a bad crop at a glance.  all-in-all - great shot - 9</td>', 'This is a great subject. Excellent detail, and I love the color tones. I do wonder if you took shots from other angles and settled in on this as a final choice. The crop is a little tight for my taste, I''d like to see more of this photogenic creature in the shot. I don''t like the tiny tan key-line border on this because it almost looks like a bad crop at a glance.  all-in-all - great shot - 9', '2003-08-03 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(375225, 30586, 5792, '<td valign="top">I really like images like this one. It full frame is the focal point and the casual arrangement of the cherries makes this look delicious. The lighting is just right (at least on my monitor) Very nice!</td>', 'I really like images like this one. It full frame is the focal point and the casual arrangement of the cherries makes this look delicious. The lighting is just right (at least on my monitor) Very nice!', '2003-08-03 15:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(375226, 30557, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Angle of the face makes this a good image.</td>', 'Nice capture. Angle of the face makes this a good image.', '2003-08-03 15:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(375232, 30580, 5792, '<td valign="top">For a challenge called "fill the frame" the white border is a bit of a distraction. It may be just me but I only seem to notice a border only when it detracts from the image.<br/> <br/>Otherwise this is a beautiful image that fits the challenge better than most others. I like images with that have lots of the same object and they are casually distributed around the frame with no particular focal point.</td>', 'For a challenge called "fill the frame" the white border is a bit of a distraction. It may be just me but I only seem to notice a border only when it detracts from the image. Otherwise this is a beautiful image that fits the challenge better than most others. I like images with that have lots of the same object and they are casually distributed around the frame with no particular focal point.', '2003-08-03 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(375233, 30565, 5792, '<td valign="top">Why would an image like this have to be validated? Don''t people know that is how this type of plant grows?</td>', 'Why would an image like this have to be validated? Don''t people know that is how this type of plant grows?', '2003-08-03 15:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(375234, 30691, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Lots of guys make a lifestyle out of peeking down women''s tops. You, however, have turned it into a quality artform. I wonder if I...</td>', 'Interesting shot. Lots of guys make a lifestyle out of peeking down women''s tops. You, however, have turned it into a quality artform. I wonder if I...', '2003-08-03 15:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
