(375260, 30620, 6388, '<td valign="top">you''ve got a great eye.  that''s a really cool looking root.  nice colours and texture to this pic.  subtle black border was a good choice too.  The bottom left corner inthe only part i don''t love, since the root falls off a bit.  pretty hard to avoid, since you needed to keep the ''image'' in the frame.  nice job</td>', 'you''ve got a great eye.  that''s a really cool looking root.  nice colours and texture to this pic.  subtle black border was a good choice too.  The bottom left corner inthe only part i don''t love, since the root falls off a bit.  pretty hard to avoid, since you needed to keep the ''image'' in the frame.  nice job', '2003-08-03 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(375261, 30768, 6388, '<td valign="top">i''d have even cropped this a little tighter; not to fillmore of the frame, just to clean up the shadows in the corners a bit.  nice shot.</td>', 'i''d have even cropped this a little tighter; not to fillmore of the frame, just to clean up the shadows in the corners a bit.  nice shot.', '2003-08-03 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(375262, 30658, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little hard to discern the visitor, but i like the idea.  good lighting...aould have been a little less tightly cropped and still fit the challenge i think.  nice shot.</td>', 'a little hard to discern the visitor, but i like the idea.  good lighting...aould have been a little less tightly cropped and still fit the challenge i think.  nice shot.', '2003-08-03 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
