(375317, 30766, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject coupled with an attractive composition. Might have been nice to get a bit closer so we could see more detail.</td>', 'Good choice of subject coupled with an attractive composition. Might have been nice to get a bit closer so we could see more detail.', '2003-08-03 17:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
