(375358, 30160, 5792, '<td valign="top">WOW. Powerful image that fits this challenge well.</td>', 'WOW. Powerful image that fits this challenge well.', '2003-08-03 18:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(375360, 30344, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Nicely done. Meets the challenge well.', '2003-08-03 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(375364, 30687, 5792, '<td valign="top">You can tell a lot about a person by the treasures they proudly display on their refridgerator doors.<br/> <br/>What do you suppose is revealed here?</td>', 'You can tell a lot about a person by the treasures they proudly display on their refridgerator doors. What do you suppose is revealed here?', '2003-08-03 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(375371, 30226, 5792, '<td valign="top">I continue to be amazed at what triggers validation by system administrators.<br/> <br/>This is a nice image. Just judge it to your own criteria. Perhaps some will think this is a 10 and others will think it is a 1.<br/> <br/>As for me I think...  ;)</td>', 'I continue to be amazed at what triggers validation by system administrators. This is a nice image. Just judge it to your own criteria. Perhaps some will think this is a 10 and others will think it is a 1. As for me I think...  ;)', '2003-08-03 18:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(375372, 30490, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting house. I would like to see it some time.</td>', 'Interesting house. I would like to see it some time.', '2003-08-03 18:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(375376, 30188, 5792, '<td valign="top">I had occasion to visit a number of rural fire stations recently. I was amazed at how incredibly clean they are, especially given that they wallow in soot at fires all the time.</td>', 'I had occasion to visit a number of rural fire stations recently. I was amazed at how incredibly clean they are, especially given that they wallow in soot at fires all the time.', '2003-08-03 18:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(375383, 30799, 5792, '<td valign="top">I hope you tell us the story behind this image in your description. I''m fascinated.<br/> <br/>This is an excellant image. The composition is great with the three detectives wearing glasses. Their intensity makes this image scream out at you, "What are they looking at?".  Inquiring minds want to know!<br/> <br/>Nice job creating suspense. Now, does your description deliver?</td>', 'I hope you tell us the story behind this image in your description. I''m fascinated. This is an excellant image. The composition is great with the three detectives wearing glasses. Their intensity makes this image scream out at you, "What are they looking at?".  Inquiring minds want to know! Nice job creating suspense. Now, does your description deliver?', '2003-08-03 18:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(375385, 30575, 5792, '<td valign="top">One fine image.</td>', 'One fine image.', '2003-08-03 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(375387, 30732, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. nice use of ROT.</td>', 'This is beautiful. nice use of ROT.', '2003-08-03 18:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(375394, 30579, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice. Not quite ROT, but close. I like it.</td>', 'Nice. Not quite ROT, but close. I like it.', '2003-08-03 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(375399, 30339, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very, very  nice image except I find the flower on the lower center right being out of focus to be a distraction, but something tells me you already know that.</td>', 'A very, very  nice image except I find the flower on the lower center right being out of focus to be a distraction, but something tells me you already know that.', '2003-08-03 18:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
