(375462, 30339, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty colouring, but focus is a bit soft and the composition doesn''t show many flowers entirely...most are cropped it seems. In other words, I think the composition could be improved, by rearranging the flowers.</td>', 'Pretty colouring, but focus is a bit soft and the composition doesn''t show many flowers entirely...most are cropped it seems. In other words, I think the composition could be improved, by rearranging the flowers.', '2003-08-03 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(375465, 30749, 5792, '<td valign="top">DPCers will forever amaze my by their creativity.<br/> <br/>You have succeeded! This is a very creative image.<br/> <br/>Modesty prevents me from saying what my first thought was upon seeing this one.<br/> <br/></td>', 'DPCers will forever amaze my by their creativity. You have succeeded! This is a very creative image. Modesty prevents me from saying what my first thought was upon seeing this one. ', '2003-08-03 19:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
