(375510, 30685, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like all but the labels.  I realize you probably grabbed this shot at a market and might have been reluctant to rearrange them.  Tehehehe....I''ve done it.  But I also got asked to stop taking pics in the store.  :-(<br/>Overall good job!</td>', 'I like all but the labels.  I realize you probably grabbed this shot at a market and might have been reluctant to rearrange them.  Tehehehe....I''ve done it.  But I also got asked to stop taking pics in the store.  :-(Overall good job!', '2003-08-03 20:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
