(375619, 30769, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great interpretation of the challence.  I love the brighter lighting in his mane bringing out the details of each hair, but what I find most interesting are the folds of the skin of his neck.  It adds depth and character.  I can''t give you a vote but if I could, you''d be right up there.  Great job.</td>', 'I think this is a great interpretation of the challence.  I love the brighter lighting in his mane bringing out the details of each hair, but what I find most interesting are the folds of the skin of his neck.  It adds depth and character.  I can''t give you a vote but if I could, you''d be right up there.  Great job.', '2003-08-03 22:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(375620, 30804, 259, '<td valign="top">your not filling anything with that pull.</td>', 'your not filling anything with that pull.', '2003-08-03 22:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(375621, 30591, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love that you kept this in black and white and the lighting is fabulous.  I don''t know if you intended a soft focus for artisitic sake, but in this case, a shaper image might have worked better. Particdularly at the bottom of the shot, it seems a little too out of focus, detracting from an otherwise perfect shot.</td>', 'I love that you kept this in black and white and the lighting is fabulous.  I don''t know if you intended a soft focus for artisitic sake, but in this case, a shaper image might have worked better. Particdularly at the bottom of the shot, it seems a little too out of focus, detracting from an otherwise perfect shot.', '2003-08-03 22:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(375622, 30620, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I love when a piece of nature is captured in such a way that it looks like something other than what it is. Yes, you can tell ther is bark in the photo, but it has more of a feel of a piece of modern art than of a tree root.  What I find particularly interesting are the areas of red...almost like blood.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I love when a piece of nature is captured in such a way that it looks like something other than what it is. Yes, you can tell ther is bark in the photo, but it has more of a feel of a piece of modern art than of a tree root.  What I find particularly interesting are the areas of red...almost like blood.', '2003-08-03 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(375623, 30667, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''m very fond of the lines in this, I like shots of escalators. Your choice of bw really does justice to the shiny chrome, and I like how the shot is balanced.</td>', 'I''m very fond of the lines in this, I like shots of escalators. Your choice of bw really does justice to the shiny chrome, and I like how the shot is balanced.', '2003-08-03 22:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(375624, 30667, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool pic!  i love all the reflections and the awesome leading lines.  well done!</td>', 'very cool pic!  i love all the reflections and the awesome leading lines.  well done!', '2003-08-03 22:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(375625, 30769, 7711, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the light on this shot, and the textures you captured with the wrinkles in his neck. 9</td>', 'I absolutely love the light on this shot, and the textures you captured with the wrinkles in his neck. 9', '2003-08-03 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(375626, 30779, 8911, '<td valign="top">Overall a very nice photo, though I think it could have been better. The reflection on the spade in the bottom center is a bit distracting - and the 9 of diamonds breaks the composition a little, looks enough like it belongs to draw the eye; I think it might have worked better with a spade or club there.</td>', 'Overall a very nice photo, though I think it could have been better. The reflection on the spade in the bottom center is a bit distracting - and the 9 of diamonds breaks the composition a little, looks enough like it belongs to draw the eye; I think it might have worked better with a spade or club there.', '2003-08-03 22:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(375627, 30282, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this will score, but for me..I feel like every picture should tell some sort of story or represent something, and I just can''t find what this one represesnts. Maybe a tigher crop on just the numbers (are they flood markers? or just mooring numbers?)</td>', 'I''m not sure how this will score, but for me..I feel like every picture should tell some sort of story or represent something, and I just can''t find what this one represesnts. Maybe a tigher crop on just the numbers (are they flood markers? or just mooring numbers?)', '2003-08-03 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(375628, 30813, 9295, '<td valign="top">For this particular challenge, I would have liked to have seen you pull in a little tighter to lose every bit of the background.  Your lighting may be a little harsh. Losing the reflection on her forehead and cheek might soften her skin and complexion. Nice capture of her eyes.</td>', 'For this particular challenge, I would have liked to have seen you pull in a little tighter to lose every bit of the background.  Your lighting may be a little harsh. Losing the reflection on her forehead and cheek might soften her skin and complexion. Nice capture of her eyes.', '2003-08-03 22:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(375631, 30580, 9295, '<td valign="top">Great colors, really enhanced bu the brightness of your lighting.  I love the title too.  This is a "fun" photo.  Very appropriate for this "back to school" time of year.</td>', 'Great colors, really enhanced bu the brightness of your lighting.  I love the title too.  This is a "fun" photo.  Very appropriate for this "back to school" time of year.', '2003-08-03 23:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(375632, 30802, 8911, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice vivid color, and I like the shapes - but I really wish the whole of the flower were in focus; instead, the pieces that don''t curl up toward the camera are blurry, but it''s hard to take part of the subject as "background" and part as "foreground"....</td>', 'That''s a nice vivid color, and I like the shapes - but I really wish the whole of the flower were in focus; instead, the pieces that don''t curl up toward the camera are blurry, but it''s hard to take part of the subject as "background" and part as "foreground"....', '2003-08-03 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(375633, 30710, 7711, '<td valign="top">I really love this. You almost don''t know its an elephant, but the lighting and composition are magnificent. The details captured really make this shot, down to the hair and dirt on his face.</td>', 'I really love this. You almost don''t know its an elephant, but the lighting and composition are magnificent. The details captured really make this shot, down to the hair and dirt on his face.', '2003-08-03 23:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(375634, 30180, 2983, '<td valign="top">Great lines and flow, and the lighting is nice.  I like the soft tones and texture, interrupted by sharp points and contrasts.</td>', 'Great lines and flow, and the lighting is nice.  I like the soft tones and texture, interrupted by sharp points and contrasts.', '2003-08-03 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(375635, 30530, 7711, '<td valign="top">a bit over exposed on the cat''s face and ear of the second cat, but I love the mix of the two animals where they almost blend together, and that tongue is cute. :)</td>', 'a bit over exposed on the cat''s face and ear of the second cat, but I love the mix of the two animals where they almost blend together, and that tongue is cute. :)', '2003-08-03 23:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(375636, 30714, 2983, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and the intense contrast.  My interest tends to drift, though.  I''d try fewer clothespins, in a tighter macro.</td>', 'I like the textures and the intense contrast.  My interest tends to drift, though.  I''d try fewer clothespins, in a tighter macro.', '2003-08-03 23:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(375637, 30750, 7711, '<td valign="top">magnificent! what beautifully captured detail. I like the angle, and the dark, moody sort of lighting, and the catchlights in the eyes.</td>', 'magnificent! what beautifully captured detail. I like the angle, and the dark, moody sort of lighting, and the catchlights in the eyes.', '2003-08-03 23:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(375638, 30160, 9295, '<td valign="top">As being a fan and semi-collector of gargoyle statuettes, I appreciate this shot a great deal. You did a fantastic job of filling the frame and capturing the details carved into the stone.  The shadow cast by his brow intensifies the forboding look in his eye and I am intrigued by what the rest of the figure might look like.</td>', 'As being a fan and semi-collector of gargoyle statuettes, I appreciate this shot a great deal. You did a fantastic job of filling the frame and capturing the details carved into the stone.  The shadow cast by his brow intensifies the forboding look in his eye and I am intrigued by what the rest of the figure might look like.', '2003-08-03 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(375641, 30588, 2983, '<td valign="top">Great view, but it looks like it was a hazy day.  If that''s downtown Chicago, good luck finding a day that isn''t hazy and humid.  Good picture otherwise.</td>', 'Great view, but it looks like it was a hazy day.  If that''s downtown Chicago, good luck finding a day that isn''t hazy and humid.  Good picture otherwise.', '2003-08-03 23:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(375643, 30710, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  What I like best is the way you captured the unique tones of his skin. The different shades of orange, grey and brown are fascinating.  I also like the symmetry of the shot and the depth your lighting successfully creates.  Good luck. I can''t vote but I give it a 10.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  What I like best is the way you captured the unique tones of his skin. The different shades of orange, grey and brown are fascinating.  I also like the symmetry of the shot and the depth your lighting successfully creates.  Good luck. I can''t vote but I give it a 10.', '2003-08-03 23:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(375645, 30529, 9295, '<td valign="top">Although this is nicely shot, I don''t think it quite fits the theme of the challenge.  A close up is not quite the same as fill-the frame and I think in this case, by cutting off just one portion of the focal point while leaving the rest fulling in frame detracts from the overall composition of the photo.  I do like how you obtained so much detail in the character of the cork giving it depth and interest.</td>', 'Although this is nicely shot, I don''t think it quite fits the theme of the challenge.  A close up is not quite the same as fill-the frame and I think in this case, by cutting off just one portion of the focal point while leaving the rest fulling in frame detracts from the overall composition of the photo.  I do like how you obtained so much detail in the character of the cork giving it depth and interest.', '2003-08-03 23:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(375646, 30586, 7711, '<td valign="top">gosh those look delicious! What beautiful colour, and the bits of water are grand.</td>', 'gosh those look delicious! What beautiful colour, and the bits of water are grand.', '2003-08-03 23:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(375649, 30507, 9295, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I almost didn''t even view this photo because the thumbnail did little to intrigue me. Seeing it full size, I appreciate more what you were trying to achieve. It is an interesting use of light and water to create an unique concept for the challenge.  I like the individual droplets seen in the dark area at the top.  In this case, leaving that sliver of unfilled space actually enhanced your shot rather than detracting from the value of keeping within the fill the frame theme. I''m afraid it''s still not one of my favorite shots but I''m glad I took the time to inspect it further.</td>', 'I have to admit, I almost didn''t even view this photo because the thumbnail did little to intrigue me. Seeing it full size, I appreciate more what you were trying to achieve. It is an interesting use of light and water to create an unique concept for the challenge.  I like the individual droplets seen in the dark area at the top.  In this case, leaving that sliver of unfilled space actually enhanced your shot rather than detracting from the value of keeping within the fill the frame theme. I''m afraid it''s still not one of my favorite shots but I''m glad I took the time to inspect it further.', '2003-08-03 23:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(375652, 30246, 9295, '<td valign="top">If your title didn''t say what this was, I would have never guessed.  Funky colors. Certainly not something I would have attributed to a lobster.  I''m trying to decide whether or not I like the lighting or if it seems a little dark, but I think the fact that you are making me sit here pondering it is a good thing. It certainly is interesting.</td>', 'If your title didn''t say what this was, I would have never guessed.  Funky colors. Certainly not something I would have attributed to a lobster.  I''m trying to decide whether or not I like the lighting or if it seems a little dark, but I think the fact that you are making me sit here pondering it is a good thing. It certainly is interesting.', '2003-08-03 23:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(375653, 30085, 8816, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  Great urban picture.  The symmetry really compliments it!  8!</td>', 'I love this shot!  Great urban picture.  The symmetry really compliments it!  8!', '2003-08-03 23:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(375655, 30160, 8816, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The texture is superb and the look on the statues face is wonderful!  The image is nice and clear, and easy on the eyes! 8!</td>', 'Very nice!  The texture is superb and the look on the statues face is wonderful!  The image is nice and clear, and easy on the eyes! 8!', '2003-08-03 23:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(375658, 30667, 8816, '<td valign="top">very cool photo.  A great i dea.  The black and white really make this photo interesting.  The mixture of chrome, steel, and glass really make this photo spectacular... very nice 9!</td>', 'very cool photo.  A great i dea.  The black and white really make this photo interesting.  The mixture of chrome, steel, and glass really make this photo spectacular... very nice 9!', '2003-08-03 23:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(375659, 30691, 8816, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and execution of this photo.  You really managed to make the shirt appear full straight black.  Nice job and nice tits ;-)  8!</td>', 'I like the concept and execution of this photo.  You really managed to make the shirt appear full straight black.  Nice job and nice tits ;-)  8!', '2003-08-03 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(375661, 30188, 8911, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s quite an impressive array of gear - almost dizzying to look at, really. This is a good crisp shot and an interesting subject; I just wish I had somewhere to rest my eyes in it, fewer items to look at at once.</td>', 'Wow - that''s quite an impressive array of gear - almost dizzying to look at, really. This is a good crisp shot and an interesting subject; I just wish I had somewhere to rest my eyes in it, fewer items to look at at once.', '2003-08-03 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(375663, 30578, 8816, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that purple?  Nice shot!</td>', 'Isn''t that purple?  Nice shot!', '2003-08-03 23:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(375664, 30280, 2983, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, and the composition is great.  Nice angle and perspective, it''s unconventional, and I like the clock in the corner</td>', 'Great contrast, and the composition is great.  Nice angle and perspective, it''s unconventional, and I like the clock in the corner', '2003-08-03 23:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(375668, 30173, 2983, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition.  This picture is simple and striking.</td>', 'Nice color and composition.  This picture is simple and striking.', '2003-08-03 23:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(375669, 30794, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the lighting and focus need help.  Looks like you used a head-on light source, which kills the detail in the cat''s features.</td>', 'Good composition, but the lighting and focus need help.  Looks like you used a head-on light source, which kills the detail in the cat''s features.', '2003-08-03 23:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(375671, 30620, 2983, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like abstract stained-glass art.  Lt looks like a little man with a beer keg under each arm.  Great find.</td>', 'This almost looks like abstract stained-glass art.  Lt looks like a little man with a beer keg under each arm.  Great find.', '2003-08-03 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(375681, 30771, 8911, '<td valign="top">I love the lines nad patterns this creates. Amazing (to me, anyway) that the sky doesn''t wash out the foreground, but the lighting is nicely controlled.</td>', 'I love the lines nad patterns this creates. Amazing (to me, anyway) that the sky doesn''t wash out the foreground, but the lighting is nicely controlled.', '2003-08-04 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(375682, 30525, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely subject. I''d have liked to see a bit more of the tree-top, a bit less of the trunk - more a straight-up shot - especially as the bright light seems to wash out the bottom part of the trunk. Or maybe just a tighter crop, removing the lower part of the picture, if another angle wasn''t workable.</td>', 'This is a lovely subject. I''d have liked to see a bit more of the tree-top, a bit less of the trunk - more a straight-up shot - especially as the bright light seems to wash out the bottom part of the trunk. Or maybe just a tighter crop, removing the lower part of the picture, if another angle wasn''t workable.', '2003-08-04 00:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(375684, 30603, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a very cute pose, but I''m not sure it''s filling the frame. More than that, almost everything - the line of the boy''s face, the horse''s eye - seems to be somewhat out of focus. I''m not sure what (the ear? the fence?) the camera latched on to, but the depth of focus wasn''t enough for it to bring all of the two main subjects into focus. The background being blurred out is a nice effect, but would be stronger if the subjects were in focus.</td>', 'This is a very cute pose, but I''m not sure it''s filling the frame. More than that, almost everything - the line of the boy''s face, the horse''s eye - seems to be somewhat out of focus. I''m not sure what (the ear? the fence?) the camera latched on to, but the depth of focus wasn''t enough for it to bring all of the two main subjects into focus. The background being blurred out is a nice effect, but would be stronger if the subjects were in focus.', '2003-08-04 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(375685, 30580, 8911, '<td valign="top">Hee. This one is amusing and cute. I like hte relatively crisp focus throughout. Do you sell erasers, or did you have to buy that many to produce this effect? Or borrow?</td>', 'Hee. This one is amusing and cute. I like hte relatively crisp focus throughout. Do you sell erasers, or did you have to buy that many to produce this effect? Or borrow?', '2003-08-04 00:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(375686, 30729, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this - and the designs on the front of the machine are nice. The reflections in the plastic are a slight distraction, though.</td>', 'I like this - and the designs on the front of the machine are nice. The reflections in the plastic are a slight distraction, though.', '2003-08-04 00:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(375687, 30085, 8911, '<td valign="top">The soft focus in this works well for the mood - especially coupled with black-and-white. The symmetry (or near-symmetry) helps hold this together, keeping my eyes from leaving the frame even when the lines of the staircase might otherwise result in exactly that.</td>', 'The soft focus in this works well for the mood - especially coupled with black-and-white. The symmetry (or near-symmetry) helps hold this together, keeping my eyes from leaving the frame even when the lines of the staircase might otherwise result in exactly that.', '2003-08-04 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(375688, 30195, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if that''s a very patient cat or a very impatient one, from that expression. Quite cute - but large patches of white on the right side are bright enough on my monitor to lose much or all of their detail; the lighting in this doesn''t entirely work for me. Nice composition.</td>', 'I''m not sure if that''s a very patient cat or a very impatient one, from that expression. Quite cute - but large patches of white on the right side are bright enough on my monitor to lose much or all of their detail; the lighting in this doesn''t entirely work for me. Nice composition.', '2003-08-04 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
